<title>FRANCE: PSA reiterates 1997 profit target.</title>
<headline>PSA reiterates 1997 profit target.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>PSA Peugeot Citroen chairman Jacques Calvet on Wednesday reiterated the company's objective to make a profit in 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;I repeat, as last year, that the group sets itself the goal in 1997 to remain profitable, to finance all of its investments through cashflow and to further reduce its debt,&quot; Calvet told the annual general meeting.</p>
<p>The group's 1996 net attributable profit fell 57 percent to 734 million francs.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
